WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.107 --> 00:00:01.637
Oh no!

2
00:00:01.584 --> 00:00:04.625
Houses everywhere, floating apart!

3
00:00:04.625 --> 00:00:06.598
Who belongs where?

4
00:00:06.598 --> 00:00:10.080
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

5
00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:12.757
This is Episode 65.

6
00:00:12.757 --> 00:00:14.793
Meet the family rope.

7
00:00:14.793 --> 00:00:17.218
It loops around every house.

8
00:00:17.218 --> 00:00:18.601
Pull!

9
00:00:18.601 --> 00:00:21.165
One town, all together.

10
00:00:21.165 --> 00:00:23.603
Little loops make neighborhoods.

11
00:00:23.603 --> 00:00:25.387
Blue roofs here.

12
00:00:25.387 --> 00:00:27.260
Green roofs there.

13
00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:30.214
Maya ties a red ribbon on the blue loop.

14
00:00:30.214 --> 00:00:32.690
Click, click, click!

15
00:00:32.690 --> 00:00:35.580
Every blue back door locks at once.

16
00:00:35.580 --> 00:00:38.056
One rule for the whole neighborhood.

17
00:00:38.056 --> 00:00:41.261
And one piggy bank pays for every house.

18
00:00:41.261 --> 00:00:43.347
A new house floats in.

19
00:00:43.347 --> 00:00:44.679
Loop!

20
00:00:44.679 --> 00:00:48.425
It joins the blue ones, and its door locks too.

21
00:00:48.425 --> 00:00:50.624
That is the family rope.

22
00:00:50.624 --> 00:00:53.879
Now you know AWS Organizations!

23
00:00:53.879 --> 00:00:57.700
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

